it's a lot, it's saturated

00:45:37.810 --> 00:45:41.210
and that's a great excuse
but it's also kind of true.

00:45:41.210 --> 00:45:43.470
But if you hang tight
on what your thing is

00:45:43.470 --> 00:45:45.950
