00:45:49.740 --> 00:45:51.815
If nothing else the persistence--

00:45:51.815 --> 00:45:53.650
- Or you might suck at it,
I could paint every day,

00:45:53.650 --> 00:45:57.040
I don't know, my intuition
is like, I'll be decent.

00:45:57.040 --> 00:45:59.633
Like, you know, I ended up
being great at speaking.

00:46:00.650 --> 00:46:03.483
But Calvin, I think you
need to put more reps in.

